{
"#name"
:
{
"osv"
:
null
,
"en"
:
"OSV (Open Source Vulnerabilities) project's CLI"
,
"zh"
:
"OSV（Open Source Vulnerabilities）项目的 CLI"
}
,
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"The `osv` module is the CLI for the OSV (Open Source Vulnerabilities) project, mainly used for obtaining open source vulnerability information and integrating vulnerability scanning tools to help developers and users better address software security issues.\nOSV is an open source project initiated by Google, aiming to provide a unified and easily accessible open source software vulnerability database. Its official website is https://osv.dev.\n"
,
"zh"
:
"osv 模块是 OSV（Open Source Vulnerabilities） 项目的 CLI，主要用于获取开源漏洞信息和集成漏洞扫描工具，以帮助开发者和用户更好地应对软件的安全问题。\nOSV 是一个由 Google 发起的开源项目，旨在提供一个统一和易于访问的开源软件漏洞数据库。其官网为 https://osv.dev 。\n"
}
,
"ls"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"List all Cloud Storage"
,
"zh"
:
"列出所有的 Cloud Storage"
}
,
"--app"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Demonstrate using interactive apps"
,
"zh"
:
"使用交互式 app 展示"
}
}
,
"--csv"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Using CSV format"
,
"zh"
:
"使用 CSV 格式"
}
}
,
"--json"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Using JSON format"
,
"zh"
:
"使用 JSON 格式"
}
}
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x osv ls --json"
,
"en"
:
"List all Cloud Storage and output them in JSON format"
,
"zh"
:
"列出所有的 Cloud Storage，并以 JSON 格式输出"
,
"de"
:
"Alle Cloud Storage auflisten und im JSON-Format ausgeben"
,
"es"
:
"Listar todos los Cloud Storage y mostrarlos en formato JSON"
,
"fr"
:
"Lister tous les Cloud Storage et les afficher au format JSON"
,
"it"
:
"Elenca tutti i Cloud Storage e visualizzali in formato JSON"
,
"pt"
:
"Listar todos os Cloud Storage e exibi-los em formato JSON"
,
"ru"
:
"Вывести весь Cloud Storage в формате JSON"
,
"uk"
:
"Показати весь Cloud Storage у форматі JSON"
,
"ja"
:
"すべての Cloud Storage を一覧表示し、JSON 形式で出力"
,
"ko"
:
"모든 Cloud Storage를 나열하고 JSON 형식으로 출력"
,
"cs"
:
"Vypsat všechny Cloud Storage a zobrazit je ve formátu JSON"
,
"pl"
:
"Wyświetl wszystkie Cloud Storage i wypisz je w formacie JSON"
,
"ro"
:
"Listează toate stocările Cloud și afișează-le în format JSON"
,
"tr"
:
"Tüm Cloud Storage'ı listele ve JSON formatında göster"
,
"vi"
:
"Liệt kê tất cả Cloud Storage và xuất ở định dạng JSON"
,
"th"
:
"แสดงรายการ Cloud Storage ทั้งหมดและแสดงผลเป็นรูปแบบ JSON"
,
"id"
:
"Daftarkan semua Cloud Storage dan keluarkan dalam format JSON"
}
]
}
