"scanner"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Scan for vulnerabilities using osv-scanner"
,
"zh"
:
"使用 osv-scanner 扫描漏洞"
}
,
"scan"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"scans various mediums for dependencies and matches it against the OSV database"
,
"zh"
:
"扫描各种介质的依赖关系并将其与 OSV 数据库进行匹配"
}
}
,
"fix"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"[EXPERIMENTAL] scans a manifest and/or lockfile for vulnerabilities and suggests changes for remediating them"
,
"zh"
:
"[实验] 扫描清单和/或锁文件以查找漏洞并提出修复建议"
}
}
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x osv scanner project/dir/"
,
"en"
:
"Use osv-scanner to scan Python, Node.js and other projects"
,
"zh"
:
"使用 osv-scanner 扫描 Python,Node.js 等项目"
,
"de"
:
"Mit osv-scanner Python-, Node.js- und andere Projekte scannen"
,
"es"
:
"Analizar con osv-scanner proyectos de Python, Node.js y otros"
,
"fr"
:
"Analyser avec osv-scanner des projets Python, Node.js et autres"
,
"it"
:
"Analizzare con osv-scanner progetti Python, Node.js e altri"
,
"pt"
:
"Verificar com o osv-scanner projetos em Python, Node.js e outros"
,
"ru"
:
"Сканировать osv-scanner проекты на Python, Node.js и другие"
,
"uk"
:
"Сканувати osv-scanner проєкти Python, Node.js та інші"
,
"ja"
:
"osv-scanner で Python、Node.js などのプロジェクトをスキャン"
,
"ko"
:
"osv-scanner로 Python, Node.js 등의 프로젝트를 검사"
,
"cs"
:
"Skenovat pomocí osv-scanner projekty v Pythonu, Node.js a další"
,
"pl"
:
"Skanować za pomocą osv-scanner projekty w Pythonie, Node.js i inne"
,
"ro"
:
"Scanează cu osv-scanner proiecte în Python, Node.js și altele"
,
"tr"
:
"osv-scanner ile Python, Node.js ve diğer projeleri tara"
,
"vi"
:
"Quét các dự án Python, Node.js và dự án khác bằng osv-scanner"
,
"th"
:
"ใช้ osv-scanner สแกนโปรเจกต์ Python, Node.js และโปรเจกต์อื่น ๆ"
,
"id"
:
"Gunakan osv-scanner untuk memindai proyek Python, Node.js, dan lainnya"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x osv scanner --lockfile requirements.txt"
,
"en"
:
"Use osv-scanner to scan specific files to check for packages, such as requirements.txt, package-lock.json"
,
"zh"
:
"使用 osv-scanner 扫描特定文件以检查其中的软件包，如 requirements.txt、package-lock.json"
,
"de"
:
"Mit osv-scanner bestimmte Dateien wie requirements.txt oder package-lock.json auf enthaltene Pakete prüfen"
,
"es"
:
"Analizar con osv-scanner archivos concretos para comprobar los paquetes, como requirements.txt o package-lock.json"
,
"fr"
:
"Analyser avec osv-scanner des fichiers spécifiques pour vérifier les paquets, tels que requirements.txt ou package-lock.json"
,
"it"
:
"Analizzare con osv-scanner file specifici per verificare i pacchetti, come requirements.txt o package-lock.json"
,
"pt"
:
"Verificar com o osv-scanner arquivos específicos para checar pacotes, como requirements.txt ou package-lock.json"
,
"ru"
:
"Сканировать osv-scanner конкретные файлы для проверки пакетов, например requirements.txt или package-lock.json"
,
"uk"
:
"Сканувати osv-scanner конкретні файли для перевірки пакетів, наприклад requirements.txt або package-lock.json"
,
"ja"
:
"osv-scanner で requirements.txt、package-lock.json などの特定のファイルをスキャンしてパッケージを確認"
,
"ko"
:
"osv-scanner로 requirements.txt, package-lock.json 등 특정 파일을 스캔하여 패키지 확인"
,
"cs"
:
"Skenovat pomocí osv-scanner konkrétní soubory a zkontrolovat balíčky, například requirements.txt nebo package-lock.json"
,
"pl"
:
"Skanować za pomocą osv-scanner konkretne pliki w celu sprawdzenia pakietów, takich jak requirements.txt czy package-lock.json"
,
"ro"
:
"Scanează cu osv-scanner anumite fișiere pentru a verifica pachetele, precum requirements.txt sau package-lock.json"
